# Experiment output dir (grid-cell self-clones, figures, logs).
# Ignored wholesale to avoid committing multi-MB run output and the
# self-clone working copies (one of which used to leave a recursive
# symlink artifacts/gridcell_local/M1 -> repo root that broke full-repo
# pytest collection). The handful of committed trace/needle fixtures
# below are explicitly kept tracked.
artifacts/
!artifacts/needle_chat_qwen05b.json
!artifacts/real_trace_demo.jsonl
!artifacts/real_trace_demo_audit.json
!artifacts/real_trace_v2_test.jsonl
!artifacts/real_trace_v3_test.jsonl

